{"id":"steam-828100","steam":828100,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Synstasis","summary":"SYNSTASIS is a turn-based cyberpunk RPG with tactical elements, set in a post-libertarian future where governments have been deemed irrelevant and 90% of humanity live in megacities run entirely by corporations.","about":"SYNSTASIS is a turn-based cyberpunk RPG with tactical elements, set in a post-libertarian future where governments have been deemed irrelevant and 90% of humanity live in megacities run entirely by corporations.\r\n\r\nThe story revolves around a group of scavengers of spare parts and machinery living in the underbelly of a megacity, and their unwitting entanglement in a plot that could determine the fate of 8 million people.\r\n\r\nThe game presents a futuristic world that spurs the imagination, while remaining logical and plausible, by incorporating several technologies and socio-economic concepts that are currently in development and which may become reality in the near-to-distant future.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828100/portrait.png?t=1552477365","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828100/header.jpg?t=1552477365","banner":null,"header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828100/header.jpg?t=1552477365","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828100/ss_fb5dbf68a859e6e91f36804658426a77b1bd81f2.600x338.jpg?t=1552477365","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828100/ss_fb5dbf68a859e6e91f36804658426a77b1bd81f2.jpg?t=1552477365"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828100/ss_c3eb065b5e5a9ff67aba75d4e5ed5bf97d889898.600x338.jpg?t=1552477365","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828100/ss_c3eb065b5e5a9ff67aba75d4e5ed5bf97d889898.jpg?t=1552477365"},{"t